                                        <p>Modern-scientific Ayurveda positioning + broad portfolio + modern packaging + accessible distribution + international expansion. Category-defining modern Ayurveda leadership.</p>
                                        <h3>Kapiva vs Forest Essentials vs Dabur?</h3>
